The '''Transhumanist Congress of Geno''' is the [[wikipedia:Unicameralism|unicameral]] [[wikipedia:legislature|legislature]] of [[Geno]]. It consists of 350 deputies presided over by a [[Chairman of the Transhumanist Congress|chairman]]. The Transhumanist Congress meets in the [[NAME]] building in Geno's capital city of [[Utopia (Geno)|Utopia]]. 

